<title>SINGAPORE: DBS Land buys equity in Shanghai firm.</title>
<headline>DBS Land buys equity in Shanghai firm.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's DBS Land Ltd said on Tuesday it had bought a 95 percent stake in Shanghai Xin Li Property Development Co Ltd through subsidiary Hua Sheng Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>It said Shanghai Xin Li has a registered capital of RMB 100 million (US$12.06 million) and will undertake a housing development project in the Jingan district in Shanghai.</p>
<p>US$1.00 = RMB 8.29</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 870 3080)</p>
